content.text:
there are still several instui component elements that we need to override with our themes in a smart way, maintaining our accessibility contrast.
prose.css:
```
:where(body) a {
	color: var(--instui-color-text-interactive-navigation-primary-base);
	text-decoration: underline;
}
:where(body) a:hover {
	color: var(--instui-color-text-interactive-navigation-primary-hover);
}
:where(a, button, input, select, textarea, summary, [tabindex]):where(:focus-visible) {
	outline-color: var(--instui-focus-outline-color);
	outline-offset: var(--instui-focus-outline-offset);
	border-radius: var(--instui-focus-outline-radius);
}
